<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SpecifyUI: Supporting Iterative UI Design Intent Expression through Structured Specifications and Generative AI</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
